    <briefdescription>
<para>Single-factor affine base class. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Single-factor models with an analytical formula for discount bonds should inherit from this class. They must then implement the functions <formula id="289">$ A(t,T) $</formula> and <formula id="290">$ B(t,T) $</formula> such that <formula id="291">\[ P(t, T, r_t) = A(t,T)e^{ -B(t,T) r_t}. \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
